1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,650
A medical student practises on models, never on strangers in the street. Security learners need practice targets too.

2
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:19,100
Build a home lab, and use apps made to be attacked, like OWASP Juice Shop, or platforms like TryHackMe.

3
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:27,825
Use virtual machines on a private network that cannot reach the internet or your home devices.

4
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:33,845
Take snapshots, so you can reset everything after each exercise.

5
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:44,500
Some companies invite you to find bugs, and pay rewards. Read the rules first, and use only your own test accounts.

6
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,825
Write up what you learn, and build a reputation the right way.

